The Proposed Project 

&nbsp;

Nibinamik First Nation is proposing various upgrades to the community nursing station&#39;s fuel system. Project activities will include:


	Decommissioning and removal of the old tank from the community;
	Construction of a concrete pad and placement of 50,000 L bulk fuel tank;
	Replacement of 3 existing day tanks;
	Removal and replacement of fuel system piping;
	Installation of two non-combustible fuel kiosks;
	Installation of a new control system; And
	Installation of fencing around the tank system.

